---
id: AD-Manajerial-PegawaiAbsensi
title: Activity Diagram - Manajerial Kelola Pegawai dan Absensi Admin
---
flowchart TD
  A([Mulai]) --> B[HR/Super Admin buka menu Manajerial]
  B --> C{Fitur}

  C -- Kelola Pegawai --> D[Lihat daftar pegawai]
  D --> E{Aksi CRUD}
  E -- Create --> F[Isi form pegawai baru]
  E -- Update --> G[Edit data pegawai]
  E -- Delete --> H[Konfirmasi hapus pegawai]
  E -- Read --> I[Lihat detail pegawai]
  F --> D
  G --> D
  H --> D
  I --> D

  C -- Absensi Admin --> J[Lihat rekap absensi]
  J --> K{Aksi}
  K -- Check-In/Out by admin --> L[Input absensi manual]
  K -- Edit/Hapus --> M[Ubah atau hapus data absensi]
  K -- Statistik --> N[Lihat statistik absensi]
  K -- Export --> O[Generate file export]
  L --> J
  M --> J
  N --> J
  O --> J

  C -- Selesai --> Z([Selesai])
